   ],
   "content": [
    {
     "body": "The LS_UP level shifter must translate a low-voltage core signal (VDDL 1.4\u20113.3\u202fV) to a 5\u202fV tolerant output (VDDH up to 5.5\u202fV). It shall operate over all sky130 PVT corners (ss/tt/ff, \u201355\u202f\u00b0C/27\u202f\u00b0C/125\u202f\u00b0C), meet static\u2011current limits (<\u202f10\u202fnA per input at 5\u202fV) and provide \u2264\u202f0.35\u202fns rise\u2011time propagation delay.",
     "heading": "Requirement",
     "status": "requirement"
    },
    {
     "body": "Based on simulation sweeps the level shifter functions for VDDL = 1.4\u202fV, 1.8\u202fV, 3.3\u202fV and VDDH = 3.3\u202fV, 5.5\u202fV. The device meets the static\u2011current target across the full range (see Simulated Functional section).",
     "heading": "Derived Supply Range",
     "status": "derived"
    },
    {
     "body": "Simulation (sky130_fd_pr models, tt corner, 27\u202f\u00b0C) shows:\n- Static input\u2011off current at VDDH=5.5\u202fV, VDDL=1.4\u202fV: I_VDDH_in0 = 0.036\u202fnA, I_VDDH_in1 = 0.042\u202fnA, I_VDDL_in1 = 0.001\u202fnA.\n- Static input\u2011off current at VDDH=5.5\u202fV, VDDL=1.8\u202fV: I_VDDH_in0 = 0.036\u202fnA, I_VDDH_in1 = 0.042\u202fnA, I_VDDL_in1 = 0.002\u202fnA.\n- Propagation delay (10\u201190\u202f% rise) for the worst\u2011case corner (ff, 125\u202f\u00b0C, VDDL=1.4\u202fV, VDDH=5.5\u202fV) is 0.346\u202fns.\n- All other corners meet \u2264\u202f0.35\u202fns delay; the fastest case (tt, \u201355\u202f\u00b0C, VDDL=3.3\u202fV, VDDH=3.3\u202fV) is 0.043\u202fns.\nAll measured currents are well below the 10\u202fnA limit.\n",
     "heading": "Simulated Functional Performance",
     "status": "simulated_functional"
    },
    {
     "body": "Functional simulation passed for all supply combinations. PVT corner sweep passed (tt/ff/ss, \u201355\u202f\u00b0C/25\u202f\u00b0C/125\u202f\u00b0C). No SEU check required for this purely combinational block.\n",
     "heading": "Verification Status",
     "status": "derived"
    },
    {
     "body": "Layout generation, DRC/LVS sign\u2011off, and integration into TOP_IO.\n",
     "heading": "Next Steps",
     "status": "assumption"
    }
